---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1> Hello Baseball!</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to the official Baseball Attendance Simulator(BAS) website. We appreciate your interest in 
				reshaping the sport and our added utilities that we have to offer customers.
			</p>
			<p>
				BAS is a San Diego based startup focused on <strong>merging public MLB datasets and using advanced coding techniques</strong>
				 to extract and estimate valuable key data that could make a key difference to all baseball enthusiasts alike.
			</p>
			<p>Some of our goals that we strive to achieve with the project are:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Go a step further and present manageable and measurable ticket pricing data that leads to improved revenue</li>

				<li>Harness the power of machine learning and artificial intelligence to replace outdated systems</li>

				<li>Create a user friendly application that can be deployed for a variety of scenarios anywhere </li>

				<li>Extract patterns that lead to better results</li>

			</ul>
			<p>
				Want a guide? <strong>Check out our <a href="/markdown-style-guide">User manual</a>.</strong>
			</p>
			<p>
				Again, welcome to BAS and we hope to hear from you soon.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
